{
  "$comment": [
    "`rootDir` remonte d'un cran et `include` nomme un fichier du dashboard : c'est le seul",
    "moyen de type-vérifier un test qui porte sur ses fonctions pures. Le dashboard a sa propre",
    "configuration (cible navigateur, JSX) et n'est pas dans la solution `tsc -b`, donc on ne peut",
    "pas le référencer comme un paquet. Seules des fonctions sans dépendance au DOM traversent",
    "ainsi la frontière ; le rendu, lui, attend Playwright en Slice 3."
  ],
  "extends": "../tsconfig.base.json",
  "compilerOptions": { "rootDir": "..", "outDir": "dist", "noEmit": false },
  "include": ["**/*.ts", "../apps/dashboard/src/lib/utils.ts", "../apps/dashboard/src/lib/patch.ts", "../apps/dashboard/src/lib/tree.ts", "../apps/dashboard/src/lib/agents.ts", "../apps/dashboard/src/lib/thread.ts", "../apps/dashboard/src/lib/terminal.ts", "../apps/dashboard/src/lib/files.ts", "../apps/dashboard/src/lib/browser.ts", "../apps/dashboard/src/lib/timeline.ts", "../apps/dashboard/src/lib/bundle.ts"],
  "exclude": ["dist"],
  "references": [
    { "path": "../packages/contracts" },
    { "path": "../packages/secrets" },
    { "path": "../packages/providers" },
    { "path": "../packages/tools" },
    { "path": "../packages/browser" },
    { "path": "../packages/mcp-client" },
    { "path": "../packages/workspace" },
    { "path": "../packages/agent-runtime" },
    { "path": "../packages/persistence" },
    { "path": "../packages/daemon" },
    { "path": "../packages/mcp-server" },
    { "path": "../packages/cli" }
  ]
}
